ctrl-exec (0.8.11) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rename the control-host binary package from "ctrl-exec" to
    "ctrl-exec-dispatcher" so it is immediately distinguishable from
    ctrl-exec-agent and ctrl-exec-common in a package or file listing.
    The new package Provides/Replaces/Conflicts the former "ctrl-exec"
    name so existing installs upgrade cleanly. The source package, the
    ctrl-exec-dispatcher binary, the /etc/ctrl-exec paths and the
    ctrl-exec system group are unchanged.

 -- OpenDigital CC <sjm@opendigital.cc>  Fri, 12 Jun 2026 09:34:21 +0100

